  [24.2c vp vg = c^2 at w = 1.1 wp; vg < c < vp] OK
  (c) w = 1.5 wp: vp = 1.341641 c, vg = 0.745356 c, vp vg / c^2 = 1.000000000
  [24.2c vp vg = c^2 at w = 1.5 wp; vg < c < vp] OK
  (c) w = 3.0 wp: vp = 1.060660 c, vg = 0.942809 c, vp vg / c^2 = 1.000000000
